{"material_id": "ntce.xiaoxue.zonghe.2013a.q30.material.recovered", "text": "《没有爱就没有教育》http：／www．56．com／u52／v_MzMwMjUIOTE．htm1(参考视频)霍懋征，名言：没有爱就没有教育，没有兴趣就没有教育。没有教不好的学生，只有不会教的老师。教育教育，为育而教，不是为教而育。", "source_files": [{"path": "教资/真题/小学真题/2013年上半年教师资格证考试《综合素质》（小学）真题.csv", "role": "material_raw", "sha256": "17158961d5065cadaa2eb3efad6d79844aed332774350fa3069832d120b4d0fa", "locator": {"decoded_csv_character_start": 2583, "decoded_csv_character_end": 2699, "next_source_question_number": 31, "alignment_status": "unique_task_excerpt_with_preceding_case_section"}}, {"path": "教资/真题/小学真题/2013年上半年教师资格证考试《综合素质》（小学）真题.csv", "role": "question_raw", "locator": {"paper_order": 30, "alignment_status": "pending"}, "sha256": "17158961d5065cadaa2eb3efad6d79844aed332774350fa3069832d120b4d0fa"}], "review": {"content_verified": false, "status": "auto_parsed", "extraction_status": "source_interval_recovered_pending_expert"}, "question_ids": ["ntce.xiaoxue.zonghe.2013a.q30"], "knowledge_node_ids": ["ntce.xiaoxue.zonghe.m1.k1", "ntce.xiaoxue.zonghe.m3.k03", "ntce.xiaoxue.zonghe.m5.k2"], "ability_ids": ["ntce.xiaoxue.ability.ethics", "ntce.xiaoxue.ability.literacy"], "exam_requirement_ids": ["ntce.outline.201.r001", "ntce.outline.201.r002", "ntce.outline.201.r003", "ntce.outline.201.r007", "ntce.outline.201.r018", "ntce.outline.201.r023"], "used_by_questions": ["ntce.xiaoxue.zonghe.2013a.q30"], "word_count": 116, "level": "xiaoxue", "subject": "zonghe", "kind": "case_material", "source": {"origin_file": "教资/真题/小学真题/2013年上半年教师资格证考试《综合素质》（小学）真题.csv", "files": [{"path": "教资/真题/小学真题/2013年上半年教师资格证考试《综合素质》（小学）真题.csv", "role": "material_raw", "sha256": "17158961d5065cadaa2eb3efad6d79844aed332774350fa3069832d120b4d0fa", "locator": {"decoded_csv_character_start": 2583, "decoded_csv_character_end": 2699, "next_source_question_number": 31, "alignment_status": "unique_task_excerpt_with_preceding_case_section"}}, {"path": "教资/真题/小学真题/2013年上半年教师资格证考试《综合素质》（小学）真题.csv", "role": "question_raw", "locator": {"pap